{
  "title": "DBMS-Benchmarker",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "description": "<p>DBMS-Benchmarker is a Python-based application-level blackbox benchmark tool for Database Management Systems (DBMS). It connects to a given list of DBMS via JDBC and runs a given list of parametrized and randomized (SQL) benchmark queries. Evaluations are available via a Python interface, in reports and in an interactive multi-dimensional dashboard.</p><p>Documentation: <a href=\"https://dbmsbenchmarker.readthedocs.io\">dbmsbenchmarker.readthedocs.io</a></p>",
